    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475160/extras/60c5ed724ef5d77718a8e792a25185c9.avif?t=1614202917\" /></div><br>Feature of game: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Changing gravity <br></li><li>Complex puzzles  <br></li><li>Mystical atmosphere <br></li><li>Magic reducing mushrooms <br></li><li>Atmospheric music  <br></li><li>Progress <br></li><li>Original story </li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475160/extras/f5acbcbc5f9b635fc4266acb56402642.poster.avif?t=1614202917\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475160/extras/f5acbcbc5f9b635fc4266acb56402642.webm?t=1614202917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475160/extras/f5acbcbc5f9b635fc4266acb56402642.mp4?t=1614202917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br>Moi Mei 2 is an independent story filled with events from an alternate universe. Immerse yourself in the dark world of Moi Mei with the main character Mei.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475160/extras/1e19bfa00e4cc774385fde09e1bbdf0f.poster.avif?t=1614202917\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475160/extras/1e19bfa00e4cc774385fde09e1bbdf0f.webm?t=1614202917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475160/extras/1e19bfa00e4cc774385fde09e1bbdf0f.mp4?t=1614202917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
